00:56:41.690 --> 00:56:43.430
When did you fall in love with Villanova basketball?

00:56:44.720 --> 00:56:47.720
I know exactly when, and it was right here in Houston

00:56:47.720 --> 00:56:52.870
in 71 when Villanova beat Western Kentucky

00:56:52.870 --> 00:56:53.930
in double overtime.

00:56:54.370 --> 00:56:56.300
Hank Simitowski fouled out.

00:56:56.480 --> 00:56:58.240
He was pounding his fist on the floor.

00:56:58.360 --> 00:56:59.700
I was 10 years old.

00:57:00.120 --> 00:57:02.360
I was crying because I thought they were going to lose.

00:57:02.920 --> 00:57:06.560
And Joe McDowell came in off the bench and Villanova beat Western Kentucky

00:57:06.560 --> 00:57:09.780
and then went on to play UCLA in a championship game.

00:57:10.080 --> 00:57:11.720
And UCLA held the ball.

00:57:12.290 --> 00:57:14.410
John Wooden used to always complain about teams holding the ball.

00:57:14.720 --> 00:57:16.880
They got a lead against Villanova and they held the ball.

00:57:17.540 --> 00:57:22.140
So if this goes back to 1971, what does it mean to you that you're now coaching

00:57:22.140 --> 00:57:26.290
that team that you fell in love with in 1971 to a potential national championship?

00:57:27.030 --> 00:57:29.830
You know, I still pinch myself all the time.

00:57:30.000 --> 00:57:35.500
In Philadelphia, when we play a big five game, if we're going on the floor, we played Temple this year in an unbelievable game in Philly.

00:57:35.800 --> 00:57:38.830
When I walk out there, I just still kind of pinch myself.

00:57:39.030 --> 00:57:44.360
Like, I would be here watching this game, and this would be as big a game to me as anything.

00:57:45.040 --> 00:57:47.560
Sometimes when you play in Philly, those games are as big as these games.

00:57:47.760 --> 00:57:51.830
And I still have to pinch myself sometimes, and I really do.

00:57:52.380 --> 00:57:55.510
My wife and I this morning just looked at each other and said, pinch me.

00:57:56.850 --> 00:57:57.850
Did she pinch you?

00:57:58.030 --> 00:57:58.530
